{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Play Unlog, our very first game !</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570210/extras/MovementKit.gif?t=1742815638\" /><strong>Master your movements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Run</strong>, <strong>jump</strong>, <strong>wall jump</strong> and <strong>dash</strong> across this dream factory to escape ! These actions can be <strong>used in many contexts</strong> to gain speed and believe us... <strong>you will need speed</strong>.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570210/extras/Escape.gif?t=1742815638\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Escape the dream factory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>YoU'rE nOt WelComE HEre !</strong> <br>The factory is filled with <strong>obstacles</strong>, <strong>traps</strong> and we heard <strong>something guards the exit</strong> so be sure to be ready !\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570210/extras/Score.gif?t=1742815638\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Make this place your playground</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlog is <strong>4\u00a0level-long</strong> but you can find <strong>a timer and a scoreboard</strong> to push your limits and maybe beat our own high score...\u00a0<br> <strong>2:30 min</strong> to complete the all game. <strong>Are you up to the challenge?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3570210?t=1742815638","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3570210?t=1742815638","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570210/1b9714162d8ca2e319c9d26c07cc4168957d5581/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742815638